        "content": "## Social media caption and hashtag writer from a content calendar\nWrite the idea in a sheet; get a ready-to-edit caption and hashtags for each row.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "cbef8bf4-06ed-52e5-a888-12aa18b55462",
