        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Content calendar** and these headers in row 1 (see `sheet-headers.csv`).\n2. Fill the input columns (idea, platform). Leave caption, hashtags empty: the AI fills it.\n3. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and how many rows to process per run.\n4. Connect Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n5. Run once by hand, check the results, then switch to **Active**. It only touches rows where caption is empty.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "71b413b7-57a5-5b34-ac31-4e168f583ab9",
